{"seq":4,"slug":"food-processing","title":"食材加工","stage":"DONE","category":"cooking-food-science","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/food-processing","rating":{"composite":3.73,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.6,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.3,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"食材加工\">食材加工</h1><p>食材加工（Food Processing）是指运用物理、化学、生物学等手段，对原料食材进行有目的的处理与转化，以延长保质期、改善感官品质、提高营养可利用性或创造全新食品形态的系统工程。它是连接农业原料与餐桌食品之间的核心技术桥梁，也是现代食品工业的基础支柱。</p>\n<h2 id=\"食材加工与烹饪的关系\">食材加工与烹饪的关系</h2><p>传统烹饪本质上是一种小规模、即时性的食材加工——加热使蛋白质变性、淀粉糊化、美拉德反应产生风味。而工业化食材加工则将这些原理规模化、标准化、精确化。理解食材加工的科学原理，能让烹饪者更好地掌控食材变化规律：为什么真空低温烹饪能实现精确的蛋白质变性温度控制？为什么超高压处理能在不加热的条件下杀灭微生物？这些问题的答案都植根于食材加工的基础科学。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心技术分类\">核心技术分类</h2><p>食材加工技术可按其作用原理分为四大体系：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>热加工技术</strong>：利用热能实现杀菌、熟化、质构改变，是历史最悠久、应用最广泛的加工手段</li>\n<li><strong>非热加工技术</strong>：在常温或低温条件下通过物理场（压力、电场、等离子体等）实现微生物灭活与品质保持</li>\n<li><strong>干燥与浓缩技术</strong>：通过去除水分降低水分活度，抑制微生物生长与化学反应，实现长期保存</li>\n<li><strong>质构与结构工程</strong>：通过控制食品组分的空间排列与相互作用，创造特定的口感、外观与功能特性</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"章节导读\">章节导读</h2><p>本 Hub 按上述四大体系组织为四章。第一章深入热加工的经典技术（漂烫、灭菌、低温慢煮），第二章介绍前沿的非热加工方法（超高压、冷等离子体、脉冲电场），第三章聚焦干燥浓缩的工程实践（喷雾干燥、渗透脱水、膜浓缩），第四章探讨食品质构设计的创新领域（胶体凝胶、挤压膨化、3D 打印）。每篇文档均从工艺原理出发，结合关键工艺参数、设备构造与产品应用案例，帮助读者建立从微观机理到工程实践的完整认知框架。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"thermal-processing","title":"热加工技术","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/food-processing/thermal-processing","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"blanching-pasteurization","title":"漂烫与巴氏杀菌：温和热处理的科学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/food-processing/thermal-processing/blanching-pasteurization"},{"seq":2,"slug":"sterilization-canning","title":"商业灭菌与罐藏：强力热处理的工程实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/food-processing/thermal-processing/sterilization-canning"},{"seq":3,"slug":"sous-vide-science","title":"低温慢煮科学：精确热控制的前沿应用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/food-processing/thermal-processing/sous-vide-science"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"non-thermal-processing","title":"非热加工技术","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/food-processing/non-thermal-processing","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"high-pressure-processing","title":"超高压加工HPP：非热杀菌的商业化先驱","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/food-processing/non-thermal-processing/high-pressure-processing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cold-plasma-uv","title":"冷等离子体与紫外线：表面杀菌新技术","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/food-processing/non-thermal-processing/cold-plasma-uv"},{"seq":3,"slug":"pulsed-electric-field","title":"脉冲电场PEF：连续化液态食品非热处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/food-processing/non-thermal-processing/pulsed-electric-field"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"drying-concentration","title":"干燥与浓缩技术","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/food-processing/drying-concentration","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"spray-freeze-drying","title":"喷雾干燥与冷冻干燥：从高效到高品质的干燥技术","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/food-processing/drying-concentration/spray-freeze-drying"},{"seq":2,"slug":"osmotic-dehydration","title":"渗透脱水：温和前处理的传质工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/food-processing/drying-concentration/osmotic-dehydration"},{"seq":3,"slug":"membrane-concentration","title":"膜浓缩技术：分子级别的冷浓缩","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/food-processing/drying-concentration/membrane-concentration"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"texture-structure-engineering","title":"质构与结构工程","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/food-processing/texture-structure-engineering","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"hydrocolloids-gelling","title":"食品胶体与凝胶化：质构工程的分子工具箱","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/food-processing/texture-structure-engineering/hydrocolloids-gelling"},{"seq":2,"slug":"extrusion-technology","title":"挤压膨化技术：大规模结构创造的工程核心","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/food-processing/texture-structure-engineering/extrusion-technology"},{"seq":3,"slug":"3d-food-printing","title":"3D食品打印：数字化精确结构制造","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/food-processing/texture-structure-engineering/3d-food-printing"}]}]}